# Extending cw-doctor

See also: `cw-doctor-logs-stats.mdc` (logs/sampling/output), `cw-doctor-fzf-config.mdc` (pickers/shell).

## Add a `cw` subcommand (diagnostic)

1. Create `lib/<name>.sh` with `cw_<name>_cmd` and `cw_<name>_help`.
2. Load in `bin/cw`: `_cw_load_lib <name>`.
3. Add `case` branch in `bin/cw` (diagnostic commands use `_cw_die`, not toolkit branding).
4. Update `completions/cw.bash` if APP arg is needed.
5. Output: `_cw_section` + evidence helpers (`_cw_observed`, `_cw_likely`, `_cw_not_established`). No `cw-doctor`, no install paths in shareable output.
6. Optional APP: `cw_apps_require_app` (app required) or `cw_apps_pick_with_scope` (server-wide allowed).
7. Log analysis: use `cw_logs_sample_file` + `cw_logs_path_status` / `_cw_log_path_issue` (see logs-stats rule).
8. Fixture + assertion in `tests/run-tests.sh` when behavior is non-trivial.

## App discovery (Cloudways)

All app logic in `lib/apps.sh`:

- List: scan `$HOME/applications/*/`
- URLs: `conf/server.nginx` / `conf/server.apache` only (never execute PHP)
- Resolve: folder id or exact domain via `cw_apps_resolve`
- WordPress: `wp-config.php` or `wp-content` under `public_html`
- Do not hardcode client domains or vendor cache paths; discover under `wp-content`

## Add a bundled tool (rg, lazygit, fzf, ...)

1. Add name to `manifest/tools.list`.
2. In `lib/tools.sh` `cw_tools_install_all`, call `cw_tools_install_github` or custom installer.
3. Wrapper lands in `shims/<name>` via `cw_tools_write_wrapper` (not `bin/`).
4. `cw_state_record tool "<name>" "<version>"` inside installers.
5. Verify: `cw status`; binary `--version` / `-V`.

Tools and shims live under `$CW_ROOT`; removed by `cw uninstall` (`rm -rf $CW_ROOT`).

## Install from a clone

`install.sh` moves clone to `~/.local/opt/cw-doctor` (includes `.git`), removes clone path.

- Staged relocate with rollback; same shell after move (no `exec`)
- Preserves `.state/`, `runtime/`, `tools/` on reinstall
- `install.sh` = first-time relocate + `cw_doctor_sync` (no git pull, no `--force`)
- `cw update [--force]` = git pull + `cw_doctor_sync` (single maintenance command)
- Bundled tools: skip re-download per tool within 30 days unless `cw update --force`

## `bin/` and `shims/` layout

- `bin/cw`, `bin/cw-view` = tracked repo scripts
- `shims/*` = generated tool wrappers (`CW_SHIMS_DIR`, gitignored); PATH includes `bin` then `shims`
- Downloaded binaries live under `tools/` (gitignored)
- Runtime data (crawler list, install timestamps) under `.state/` (gitignored)

## Interactive entry points

- Bare `cw` / `cw menu` -> `cw_menu_cmd` in `lib/pick.sh`
- Omit APP on most diagnostics -> fzf app picker (domain-labeled)
- Shell: `config/shell.sh` + `config/functions.sh` (`cda`, `fcd`, `fe`, `fbat`, Ctrl+R via `fzf --bash`)
